{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105175","id":2447675284,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6R5I-U","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105175","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105175.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105175.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105175","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105175/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105175/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105175/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/bf47c42b21fc76496dda767b08ff51413da409d3","number":105175,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Detect more pipeline settings at load time to avoid pipeline stutters","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This fixes an unreported bug that created pipeline stutters at run time. \r\n\r\n### Background\r\n\r\nWe can't compile every pipeline variant at load time for the ubershader. There are too many. So we detect which ones we know we need and then only compile those. This has the bonus of reducing load times for simple games that only need a few variants. \r\n\r\nHowever, when a feature that needs a new variant is added at run time, we have to go back and compile the missing variant _for all existing pipelines_. In bigger games this can take a long time. \r\n\r\nThis is why the docs say to avoid adding things like VoxelGI nodes to the SceneTree at run time. \r\n\r\n### The problem\r\n\r\nUsing SSS or the normal_roughness_texture can trigger a new variant being added. What makes these features unique is that they were only being checked if an object that survived culling made it into the render pass. This means that you can trigger pipeline recompilations by looking around. \r\n\r\n### The solution\r\n\r\nWe can set the pipeline state when the material is assigned to the object instead of setting it when the object is first visible. This moves the cost to load time and the stutter is gone. Now the usual advice applies, just ensure that any material that uses SSS or the normal_roughness_texture is present in the SceneTree at load time and you will be fine. \r\n\r\n### Edit\r\n\r\nThe new approach is basically the same, but now checks the screen textures as well and allocates textures up front too to avoid stuttering on texture creation. On desktops, texture creation isn't really noticeable, but on mobile devices it can lead to noticeable stutter.\r\n\r\nFixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101554\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8089024095,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB4iS2Xw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.4","name":"cherrypick:4.4","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.4.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z"},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-04-09T07:02:51Z","updated_at":"202